| Unauthenticated data exposure | 🔴 CRITICAL | Security | 11-16 |
| Missing error handler | 🔴 CRITICAL | Error Handling | 3 |
| No input validation | 🟠 HIGH | Input Validation | 6, 11 |
| No server startup error handling | 🟠 HIGH | Error Handling | 18 |
| Hardcoded port | 🟡 MEDIUM | Configuration | 18 |
| No rate limiting | 🟡 MEDIUM | Security | 11-16 |
| No payload size limits | 🟡 MEDIUM | Error Handling | 5 |
| Inefficient timestamp generation | 🟡 MEDIUM | Performance | 8 |

